{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"A_title","type":"text","x":40,"y":-90,"width":1830,"height":190,"text":"## 版本 A｜1F1B 极简教学版：2 张 GPU × 4 个 MB\n\n**GPU0 / Stage0：Embedding → Block1 → Block2**   ｜   **GPU1 / Stage1：Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss**\n\n从上往下读 T1～T10；F=前向、B=反向。每次 MB 的 Backward 均使用同一 Stage 先前保存的激活。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_legend","type":"text","x":1930,"y":-90,"width":900,"height":190,"text":"## 连线图例\n\n**蓝色**：前向激活 `H2_MB*` 从 GPU0 到 GPU1\n**紫色**：反向梯度 `dH2_MB*` 从 GPU1 到 GPU0\n**橙色**：同一 GPU 的调度顺序（非张量传递）\n**灰色**：阶段收尾与参数更新","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T1","type":"group","x":40,"y":260,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T1 时间步 · 启动 / Warmup","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T1_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":295,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：F0","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T1_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":336,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · F0\n\n取 Input IDs_MB0 → Embedding → Block1 → Block2 → H2_MB0\n保存 T1 的 Stage0 激活；发送 H2_MB0 至 GPU1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T1_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":295,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：空闲","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T1_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":336,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · 空闲\n\n空闲（Bubble）：该时间步不执行此 Stage 的 F/B 计算。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T2","type":"group","x":40,"y":675,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T2 时间步 · Warmup","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T2_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":710,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：F1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T2_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":751,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · F1\n\n取 Input IDs_MB1 → Embedding → Block1 → Block2 → H2_MB1\n保存 T2 的 Stage0 激活；发送 H2_MB1 至 GPU1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T2_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":710,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：F0","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T2_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":751,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · F0\n\n接收 H2_MB0 → Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss_MB0\n保存 T2 的 Stage1 激活，供 B0 使用","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T3","type":"group","x":40,"y":1090,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T3 时间步 · 首次 Backward","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T3_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":1125,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：空闲","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T3_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":1166,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · 空闲\n\n空闲（Bubble）：该时间步不执行此 Stage 的 F/B 计算。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T3_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1125,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：B0","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T3_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":1166,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · B0\n\n从 Loss_MB0 反传；使用 T2 保存的 Stage1 激活\nLM Head → FinalNorm → Block4 → Block3 Backward\n累积梯度：MB0；发送 dH2_MB0 至 GPU0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T4","type":"group","x":40,"y":1505,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T4 时间步 · 1F1B 交替","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T4_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":1540,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：B0","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T4_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":1581,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · B0\n\n接收 dH2_MB0，使用 T1 保存的 Stage0 激活\nBlock2 → Block1 → Embedding Backward，释放激活\n累计参数梯度：MB0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T4_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1540,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：F1","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T4_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":1581,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · F1\n\n接收 H2_MB1 → Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss_MB1\n保存 T4 的 Stage1 激活，供 B1 使用","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T5","type":"group","x":40,"y":1920,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T5 时间步 · 1F1B 交替","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T5_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":1955,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：F2","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T5_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":1996,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · F2\n\n取 Input IDs_MB2 → Embedding → Block1 → Block2 → H2_MB2\n保存 T5 的 Stage0 激活；发送 H2_MB2 至 GPU1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T5_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1955,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：B1","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T5_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":1996,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · B1\n\n从 Loss_MB1 反传；使用 T4 保存的 Stage1 激活\nLM Head → FinalNorm → Block4 → Block3 Backward\n累积梯度：MB0 + MB1；发送 dH2_MB1 至 GPU0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T6","type":"group","x":40,"y":2335,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T6 时间步 · 1F1B 交替","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T6_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":2370,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：B1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T6_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":2411,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · B1\n\n接收 dH2_MB1，使用 T2 保存的 Stage0 激活\nBlock2 → Block1 → Embedding Backward，释放激活\n累计参数梯度：MB0 + MB1","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T6_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":2370,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：F2","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T6_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":2411,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · F2\n\n接收 H2_MB2 → Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss_MB2\n保存 T6 的 Stage1 激活，供 B2 使用","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T7","type":"group","x":40,"y":2750,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T7 时间步 · 1F1B 交替","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T7_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":2785,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：F3","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T7_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":2826,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · F3\n\n取 Input IDs_MB3 → Embedding → Block1 → Block2 → H2_MB3\n保存 T7 的 Stage0 激活；发送 H2_MB3 至 GPU1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T7_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":2785,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：B2","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T7_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":2826,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · B2\n\n从 Loss_MB2 反传；使用 T6 保存的 Stage1 激活\nLM Head → FinalNorm → Block4 → Block3 Backward\n累积梯度：MB0 + MB1 + MB2；发送 dH2_MB2 至 GPU0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T8","type":"group","x":40,"y":3165,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T8 时间步 · 1F1B 交替","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T8_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":3200,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：B2","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T8_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":3241,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · B2\n\n接收 dH2_MB2，使用 T5 保存的 Stage0 激活\nBlock2 → Block1 → Embedding Backward，释放激活\n累计参数梯度：MB0 + MB1 + MB2","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T8_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":3200,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：F3","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T8_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":3241,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · F3\n\n接收 H2_MB3 → Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss_MB3\n保存 T8 的 Stage1 激活，供 B3 使用","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T9","type":"group","x":40,"y":3580,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T9 时间步 · Drain","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T9_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":3615,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：空闲","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T9_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":3656,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · 空闲\n\n空闲（Bubble）：该时间步不执行此 Stage 的 F/B 计算。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T9_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":3615,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：B3","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T9_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":3656,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · B3\n\n从 Loss_MB3 反传；使用 T8 保存的 Stage1 激活\nLM Head → FinalNorm → Block4 → Block3 Backward\n累积梯度：MB0 + MB1 + MB2 + MB3；发送 dH2_MB3 至 GPU0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_grp_T10","type":"group","x":40,"y":3995,"width":1830,"height":335,"label":"T10 时间步 · Drain 结束","color":"5"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T10_GPU0","type":"group","x":135,"y":4030,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU0 / Stage0：B3","color":"3"},
		{"id":"A_task_T10_GPU0","type":"text","x":155,"y":4071,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU0 · B3\n\n接收 dH2_MB3，使用 T7 保存的 Stage0 激活\nBlock2 → Block1 → Embedding Backward，释放激活\n累计参数梯度：MB0 + MB1 + MB2 + MB3","color":"2"},
		{"id":"A_frame_T10_GPU1","type":"group","x":1050,"y":4030,"width":825,"height":265,"label":"GPU1 / Stage1：空闲","color":"6"},
		{"id":"A_task_T10_GPU1","type":"text","x":1070,"y":4071,"width":785,"height":185,"text":"### GPU1 · 空闲\n\n空闲（Bubble）：该时间步不执行此 Stage 的 F/B 计算。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"A_end","type":"text","x":300,"y":4455,"width":1360,"height":215,"text":"## T10 结束 → 阶段五：参数更新\n\nStage0 / Stage1 已分别累积 MB0 + MB1 + MB2 + MB3 的参数梯度。\n之后如有 DP 则先按约定同步，再在本 Stage 执行 `optimizer.step()`；下一轮迭代开始前清理梯度。\n\n**注意：本图沿用你的 T1～T10 调度次序，强调依赖关系，不声称其是唯一或吞吐量最优的 1F1B 排程。**","color":"5"}
	],
